WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:13.500
Software agents already have a life cycle. Today that life lives in a terminal. Hardware has no word for it.

00:13.500 --> 00:31.500
Agent Body Protocol is the missing cable. Nine named events. Four named verbs. The Lamp already knows how to move.

00:31.500 --> 00:51.500
The language is light and pose. Blue while thinking. Amber to ask. Red when stuck. Green when tests pass.

00:51.500 --> 01:02.500
Scenario one. CI is running. Blue, then green. You never opened a dashboard.

01:02.500 --> 01:12.000
Scenario two. The agent wants to push. Amber. One question. Not a monologue.

01:12.000 --> 01:22.000
Scenario three. You are stuck. Red breath. Consent first. It never types a password.

01:22.000 --> 01:30.000
The joints are the exam. Look, dance, follow. HTTP 200 is not enough.

01:30.000 --> 01:38.300
Claude, Hermes, Codex can plug in. Tomorrow the same URL is a household Lamp.
